Report style schema validators are generated at development time by Ajv 6.15.0
(MIT, copyright Evgeny Poberezkin), using the local report-style/v1 contracts.
Runtime uses Ajv's static format/Unicode helpers and fast-deep-equal (MIT).
The bounded report-style readers and template derivation modules are new local
implementations; they do not import the neighboring KORDOC engine at runtime.
